               ╭ Keybindings ───────────────────────────────────╮
               │                                                │
               │ ?           Toggle help overlay                │
               │ r           Refetch lyrics                     │
               │ f           Toggle fullscreen                  │
               │ t           Toggle title bar                   │
               │ s           Toggle status bar                  │
               │ m           Toggle display mode (normal/block) │
               │ w           Toggle word highlight              │
               │ Tab         Toggle ribbon bar                  │
               │ [           Shift timing -100 ms               │
               │ ]           Shift timing +100 ms               │
               │ \           Reset timing offset                │
               │ Up          Scroll up (unsynced)               │
               │ Down        Scroll down (unsynced)             │
               │ c, Enter    Open context menu                  │
               │ q, Ctrl+C   Quit                               │
